Subject: [PATCH] Add experimental raytrace entity culling

Motivated by EtheriumMC 0074 (8b670c2b) as described in the port
strategy. Independent implementation: a voxel-plane certificate covers
all rays between bounded eye and target regions. No upstream raytracer,
AntiXray SDK, or third-party code is imported.

